  "recreation_notes": [
    {
      "line_end": 26,
      "line_start": 1,
      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "__     __)               ____  ___)\n (, /|  /|                (, /   /          ,\n   / | / |  _  _/_ _        /---/  _   __\n) /  |/  |_(_(_(__(_(_   ) /   (__(_(_/ (__(_\n(_/   '                  (_/\n\n\n  Bally Midway Manufacturing Company (1978)\nIPD No. 4501 / April, 1978 / 4 Players\n  https://www.ipdb.org/machine.cgi?id=4501\n\n\n********************************************************************************************************************************\n******** Work done by UnclePaulie on Hybrid version 0.01 - 2.0 *********\n    Implemented latest VPW standards, physics, GI VLM, 3D inserts, AllLamps routines, shadows, backglass for desktop,\n  roth drop targets, standalone compatibility, sling corrections, optional DIP adjustments, updated flipper physics,\n  VR and fully hybrid, playfield_mesh , Flupper style bumpers and lighting. Used backglass images from Hauntfreaks.\n  Redbone updated apopis's scanned playfield, as well other graphics updates: plastics, flippers, targets, and apron images.\n  Full details at the bottom of the script.\n********************************************************************************************************************************\n\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n- All game options can be adjusted by pressing F12 and then left flipper button during the game. Press start button to save your options."
    }
